DESCRIPTION:‘Forest and Fauna’ is an exhibition by local artists Symphony Esqueda and Nikki Longfish\, viewable at the Paint Chip throughout October 2026. Visit any time during open hours to view the vibrant acrylic and graphite artworks\, and try to stop by Friday\, October 9 before 2nd Friday ArtAbout between 5-6p for the artists reception. Free event!
