SUMMARY:"The Works of Our Hands\,"  Related in Life and Design
DESCRIPTION:The Artery presents “The Works of Our Hands\,” Related in Life and Design\, featuring Amina Harris\, Patti Harris\, and Shoshana Zeldner. The exhibit extends from October 2 to 26\, with the reception on Friday\, October 9\, 6-9 pm coinciding with the Davis Second Friday ArtAbout. \nThe Works of Our Hands features three family members\, each having distinctive art forms. Amina Harris’s unique jewelry incorporates artifacts from ancient to modern times. Amina’s recent trip to Morocco inspired this exhibit. Patti\, Amina’s sister\, shows her 3-dimensional collages\, using industrial design\, natural materials and vintage objects. Shoshana\, Amina’s daughter\, creates sculptures that breath with life\, exploring the relationship between the body and the subtle experiences that take place within.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/the-works-of-our-hands-related-in-life-and-design/
LOCATION:The Artery\, 207 G Street\, Davis\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Amina-Harris-Necklace--scaled.jpeg
GEO:38.5438665;-121.73916
