SUMMARY:JBF Solano Fall Kids' Consignment Sale
DESCRIPTION:Paying full price is SCARY! Just Between Friends (JBF) Solano’s Fall Sale is here to help. Say “Yes!” to everything your family needs this October. \nYou’re invited to our HUGE one-weekend-only consignment event where local families get quality kids’ & maternity items for way below retail prices. Get everything for the season ahead all in one place and never overpay for something your family will outgrow again! \nCome check us out!\nOctober 8-11\, 2026\nThe Mission | 6391 Leisure Town Rd. in Vacaville\, CA \nHere’s everything you need to know! Just Between Friends Solano brings together more than 120 local families to sell quality used & new items they’ve outgrown. Shoppers get access to all of the merchandise (thousands of items!) at 50-90% off retail prices while our consignors make money off the items they sell. And nothing goes to waste! Sellers have the option to donate their items to our local charity partner or pick them up to sell again.\nWe’re only here for the weekend\, so don’t miss your chance to shop and sell! \nWhat kind of items are for sale?\nClothes for babies\, kids + teens\nShoes\nToys\nStrollers and car seats\nBaby gear and nursery furniture\nHalloween costumes\nBackpacks and desk organizers\nWinter clothes\nHoliday items\nBooks and games \n*Do you have these items you want to sell? It’s easy! See details below. \nI’m Ready to Shop! \nTickets are REQUIRED. Get your ticket on our website for free public shopping or choose to get early access! \nJoin us on Early Access Day (10/8) for first access to the biggest selection we have to offer! Presale shopping is limited & tickets are required. \nGet your ticket: https://jbfvacaville.ticketspice.com/gettickets \nGot your ticket? Get ready to shop! \nShoppers\, Please Note: we provide a limited number of rolling baskets and wagons for shopping. You are encouraged to bring your own wagon if you have one or a stroller can be expertly loaded in a pinch!\nWe can’t wait to shop with you! \n~JBF Solano\n______________________________________________________________________\n*Ready to sell items you no longer need? You’ve come to the right place. Join more than 120 local families making money and clearing clutter—plus you get FIRST access to the merchandise as a perk! We’ve been popping up in Solano County for 15 years serving local families and helping them say “Yes!” \nStart here: https://app.jbfsale.com/event/solano \nWelcome to the fam! \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/jbf-solano-fall-kids-consignment-sale/
LOCATION:The Mission\, 6391 Leisure Town Rd.\, Vacaville\, C\, 95687\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Community,Shopping
ORGANIZER;CN="Just Between Friends Solano":MAILTO:jbfsolano@jbfsale.com
END:VEVENT
