SUMMARY:Fall Open House
DESCRIPTION:This event is free and open to all ages. No registration needed! Lectures on raptor rehabilitation\, identification\, conservation and adaptations are presented during the day. Also\, numerous handlers are available to answer questions about the live educational ambassador raptors they will be holding on the glove. Visitors are invited to follow the self-guided tour route and to visit the Museum for a hands-on experience. \nWine & Beer Reception:\nVisitors are also invited to join us on-site for a wine- and beer-tasting reception from 12-2pm in the picnic area. Drinks are generously donated by longtime supporters Super Owl Brewing and Nashoba Wines. Must be 21+ to partake.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/fall-open-house/
LOCATION:California Raptor Center\, 1 Garrod Dr.\, Davis\, CA 95616\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Bring the Kids,Outside,Science
